```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Bot as Devin Bot
    participant Store as Worker
    participant DB as D1 (config/audit_log)
    participant Buyer as 买家

    Note over Bot,DB: 三层熔断

    Bot->>Store: POST /v1/bot/heartbeat（每 5 分钟）
    Store->>DB: last_bot_heartbeat = now

    alt 手动开关
        Buyer->>Store: POST /v1/admin/kill-switch {"value":"on"}
        Store->>DB: kill_switch = on，记 audit
    end

    alt 自动跳闸
        Bot->>Store: POST /v1/bot/tasks {"type":"check-breaker"}
        Store->>DB: 读最近 10 分钟 audit_log
        Store->>Store: 报错 ≥5 或退款失败 ≥2 或库存对不上 ≥3？
        Store->>DB: kill_switch = on，记 kill_switch_auto_trip
    end

    alt 心跳保底
        Buyer->>Store: POST /v1/orders
        Store->>DB: 查 kill_switch + last_bot_heartbeat
        Store->>Buyer: 开关开着 → 503 kill_switch_on
        Store->>Buyer: 心跳断了 >10 分钟 → 503 bot_heartbeat_stale
    end

    Note over Store,DB: 跳闸后只进不出，恢复必须人工点，bot 不能自己恢复
    Buyer->>Store: POST /v1/admin/kill-switch {"value":"off"}
    Store->>DB: kill_switch = off，记 audit
```
